Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortieth Episode\NThe Hunt\NThe Terrifying X-Union
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty, the King of Faiango, has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All those kings look so grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's the hunting competition hosted by Princess Sapphire today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's made entirely of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible, golden armor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So whoever catches the most game gets to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Polgarland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Drollery has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Buan brothers of the Kingdom of Buan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Grand Duke of the Kingdom of Orgarland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, Prince Franz of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.75,0:03:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey! He looks like such a kind and strong prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke of the Kingdom of Bosunaria!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a brighter color? I like this shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.28,0:03:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,White is nice too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been at it for an hour already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's hunt is going to be quite the grand event, Grand Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I come from the X-Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a gift from X-Union. Please accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Princess Sapphire here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She is currently changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.61,0:04:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with this one after all. Oh, hello, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.39,0:04:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. Doesn't look like Prince Franz after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you trick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, sorry, sorry! It was just a joke! Wait, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for inviting me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's start!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddy-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddy-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.55,0:05:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the more I look at it, the finer a horse it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I hear Goldland horses look impressive, but can't run at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about a race to the swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we definitely won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.81,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lord Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a huge place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz and Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let me follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.58,0:07:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking the right path. Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you. That's a graveyard. You fell right into our trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the black hawk is here. It's the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Go inform Madam Gagol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.93,0:07:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The signal hawk has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.48,0:07:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pitiful Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the signal! Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves! Get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How odd, there's no swamp here. Isn't this a graveyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.98,0:09:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how it's done. I am the greatest hunter in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, you're not the world's best hunter. I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am! I caught thirty of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me! I caught a bear this huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened to Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.34,0:10:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That clumsy prince lost the horse race to me and ran back crying to Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That Franz is truly all show and no spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.81,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's hunt was truly delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, your marksmanship is quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you were splendid as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it really was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.06,0:10:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we can't just keep enjoying ourselves forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.43,0:10:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,General! Are you aware of X-Union?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have seen it with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was truly dreadful. Before long, they will surely reach our lands as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.04,0:11:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, every single tree and blade of grass
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,across the country withered away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With no plants left, the people starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That is when X-Union strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They burn down homes and slaughter people indiscriminately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,, It all happens in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Word is they possess countless deadly weapons
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the likes of which we've never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And the food distributed afterward is laced with a drug
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that strips away the will to fight or think,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving people with no spirit to do anything—slaves to X-Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That is X-Union: a terrifying organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, the King of Garban,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:12:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,standing in for my nation, doesn't seem to be in top form today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where will they come from first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a terrifying maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,, I know it's a lie that you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.65,0:12:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.37,0:12:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz is in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Over on the other side of the forest where all the graves are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,a creepy old woman took him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.81,0:13:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland is already as good as in the hands of X-Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And when this underground empire is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we will crush Silverland with our own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, you will sleep forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A 50-ton block of iron is hanging there by a single thin rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But in a few minutes, that rope is set to snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go deeper in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.44,0:14:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.15,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard voices...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that a bit too rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it leads underground...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming! Run, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, I'm sorry. But if I freeze up now, we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you get soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.90,0:17:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.64,0:17:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So these really are the X-Union guys Fugaaf mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.57,0:17:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The people being forced to work are from other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.39,0:17:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth are they holding Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Spill it already, pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm Tink, not a pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Tell me who came with you. You couldn't have come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.32,0:18:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid. You're the runt who's always following Sapphire around, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not following her around! I'm an assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire? This kills two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tighten security around France. Kill anyone suspicious on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it? Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.98,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I teach you a lesson so you can't talk back, pipsqueak?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That young fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing such courage right after arriving... what a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two! The captain's calling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Get out of here! This is the X-Union's fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! I came to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No! If you linger, you'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.63,0:18:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You say I called for you? I said no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! It's Sapphire! She snuck in with that brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.28,0:19:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... please escape safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.23,0:19:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Franz is tied up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did that liar go? That masked X spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.46,0:19:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.11,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! I've come to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbon Knight? Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, an intruder!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! I don't care if you kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved. Thank you, Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.34,0:21:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink has been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Ribbon Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. We can't leave him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,King Noir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You were in on this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, I am Noir. Head of the Blackland division of X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.54,0:21:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz! Let me lure them into the central cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll blast them to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pursue them! Don't let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who's been enslaved!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to defeat X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:21:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.93,0:22:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, lend Ribbon Knight a hand! We'll strike down X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.18,0:22:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn those slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.65,0:22:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Noir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you! I have to contact headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one step and you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.58,0:22:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it collapsing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.53,0:23:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! The underground empire is collapsing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.15,0:23:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get over here! Ribbon, hurry out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.71,0:23:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's run! Before we get crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.49,0:24:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that Knight of the Ribbon for getting in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.41,0:24:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am just so furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch! One day, X-Union will rule Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.12,0:24:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The X-Union. So the rumors were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.17,0:24:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. If anything happens to this kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first to come protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.35,0:24:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.36,0:24:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We were saved, all thanks to you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.23,0:24:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me blush.
